text:
We had been to this restaurant before and it was better than average, but not last night when we took our guests there for dinner. I will summarize:
1. We ordered appetizer (Bademjoon), it came very late (came with the dinner). It wasn't even tasty, too salty;
2. The dinner came out 35 minutes after we ordered. Our Koobideh was hard as a rock and it had so much turmeric and fillers in it that tasted awful. Koobideh shouldn't have turmeric anyway but a little would be tolerable;
3. Our Barg was tough;
4. They serve the food on small plates. No complaints about the size of food and it wouldn't matter because the food was not good anyway;
5. They NEVER came to our table to refill our waters or to ask how the food was.
We will not dine there anymore.
